SUMMARY:Flutterby Arts Festival at Watersound Town Center
LOCATION:The Pavilion at Watersound Town Center\, 85 Origins Main St\, Wate
 rsound Town Center\, Santa Rosa Beach\, FL
DESCRIPTION:Sunday 11/8 · 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM\n\nThe Cultural Arts Allianc
 e of Walton County celebrates the monarch butterfly migration at the 34th 
 Flutterby Arts Festival. Kids get a butterfly wing station\, a monarch lea
 rning center\, face painting\, carnival games\, an inflatable slide\, a to
 ddler play area and butterfly parades\, while a holiday artist market\, fo
