DESCRIPTION:Weekly · Saturdays 12 PM-3 PM (confirm the day)\n\nDisney Lorc
 ana League is casual league play at GameMasters Guild in Crestview. Player
 s earn league points toward monthly prizes and a promo card the first time
  they play each month\, and you can borrow a deck or buy one. The shop des
